# Greater London Authority

> The official website of the Greater London Authority (GLA), the devolved
> regional government for London. Covers the Mayor of London, the London
> Assembly, and the GLA Group's policies, strategies, and programmes across
> housing, transport, environment, health, culture, democracy, and more.

## About the GLA

- [Who we are](https://www.london.gov.uk/who-we-are): Governance structure, spending, and accountability
- [What the Mayor does](https://www.london.gov.uk/who-we-are/what-mayor-does): Powers and responsibilities of the Mayor of London
- [What the London Assembly does](https://www.london.gov.uk/who-we-are/what-london-assembly-does): Scrutiny role and how the Assembly works
- [Contact City Hall](https://www.london.gov.uk/contact-or-visit-city-hall): Contact details and visiting information

## Key Strategies and Plans

- [The London Plan](https://www.london.gov.uk/programmes-strategies/planning/london-plan): The statutory spatial development strategy for London
- [London Housing Strategy](https://www.london.gov.uk/programmes-strategies/housing-and-land/mayors-priorities-londons-housing-and-land/london-housing-strategy): The Mayor's strategy for housing in London
- [London Environment Strategy](https://www.london.gov.uk/programmes-and-strategies/environment-and-climate-change/london-environment-strategy): Strategy covering air quality, climate change, green infrastructure, waste, and more
- [Culture Strategy for London](https://www.london.gov.uk/programmes-strategies/arts-and-culture/culture-strategy-london): The Mayor's strategy for culture and creative industries
- [MOPAC and policing](https://www.london.gov.uk/programmes-strategies/mayors-office-policing-and-crime-mopac): Mayor's Office for Policing and Crime: strategy, governance, and accountability

