## Research and Data

- [Research and analysis](https://www.london.gov.uk/programmes-strategies/research-and-analysis): GLA data, evidence, and published research
- [GLA Economics publications](https://www.london.gov.uk/programmes-strategies/research-and-analysis/gla-economics-publications): Economic analysis and reports
