## Democracy and Public Participation

- [London Assembly motions](https://www.london.gov.uk/motions): Formal positions voted on by the London Assembly
- [Petitions](https://www.london.gov.uk/petitions): Active and past public petitions to the Mayor and Assembly
- [Take part](https://www.london.gov.uk/take-part): Open consultations and public engagement opportunities
- [Talk London](https://www.london.gov.uk/talk-london): City Hall's online community for Londoners to have their say on big issues and help shape plans and policies
- [Governance and spending](https://www.london.gov.uk/who-we-are/governance-and-spending): Financial accounts, decisions, and procurement

